VIEWPORT CROP CLEANUP TESTS — 2026-10-09

Two representative 384x384 source crops, not whole scenes. Each was processed with the existing official Real-ESRGAN anime 6B model at genuine 4x, then the 1536x1536 model output was reduced with Pillow Lanczos to the original 384x384 size. Source files are untouched. This tests cleanup and style, not recovered detail or native-resolution generation.

